    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's all gone, isn't it? the banners, the men... all of them. i can still hear the screams of the vanguard. i led them straight into a slaughter. there's no way to fix this, no way to even look at the gods again after this disgrace. i've lost everything that made me who i was.",
